<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. We are unable to cancel your admission because you are currently enrolled in classes. Before you can cancel your admission, you must sign in to <a href="https://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a> to withdraw from your classes. <b>You must withdraw from all classes before the end of ASU’s refund period or you will be responsible for all tuition charges.</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you would still like to cancel your admission, please contact <a href="registrar@asu.edu">registrar@asu.edu</a> using your email of record with ASU (the one you provided on your application) or your offical asu.edu email address, including either your ASU ID number or date of birth (mm/dd/yy). This information is needed to verify that we are canceling the correct student’s admission.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><a href="http://www.asu.edu/">asu.edu</a></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>